      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hello Gwendal,\n\nsorry to bother you, but is it possible to have some feedback about our proposal, to accept this driver and do the refactorization work afterward?\n\nWe have a customer interested in including this chip in their next design. But code needs to be approved before middle/end of May.\n\nConcerning the mutex usage, our icm426xx driver is already using a mutex in data path without any issue. But this is something we can try to improve in the refactoring (like preventing get/set offset when the sensor is running).\n\nInitialization time has been reduced to the minimum possible, less than 1ms now. We will do the same for the icm426xx driver in the refactoring work.\n\nThanks for your help.\n\nBest regards,\nJB",
